&"1_1": {
"dialogue": "The note reads:[br]
Oof, it looks like you've stumbled into the labyrinthine [i]Cliff Side Caves[/i]. [br][br]
People frequently get lost in here, but luckily for you we made this handy map and tutorial packet for you.
[br][br]
1. You find yourself in the [el]Red[/el] Room. [br]
2. You must get to the [el]Orange[/el] Room.[br]
3. Use 'T' to open your transmutation map. [br]
4. Use the stencils from your tutorial packet to hide irrelevant info.[br]
[br]
[i]Please only take one packet, we were only able to make 3 total[/i]",
"offset": Vector2(720, -100),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_3",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 242.00009),
"speaker": ""
},
&"1_10": {
"dialogue": "Its a table with another note.",
"offset": Vector2(-240, 1040),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_11",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300, 242.00006),
"speaker": ""
},
&"1_11": {
"dialogue": "You're almost there! The exit is just up ahead.[br]
The next few puzzles use [i]Laser Bridges[/i]. These use highly concentrated Elemental energy to transmute any MagiClay objects dragged across them. [br]
Use the triangular [i]Reset[/i] block to return the puzzle to its starting configuration.",
"offset": Vector2(80, 1040),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00012, 242.00006),
"speaker": ""
},
&"1_2": {
"dialogue": "Its a table... woww. On it is a diagram labeled [i]Transmutation Map[/i], a packet of laminated pages stapled together, and a note.",
"offset": Vector2(380, -100),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_1",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00012, 242.00009),
"speaker": ""
},
&"1_3": {
"dialogue": "You take the map and the packet of stencils. It appears you grabbed the last ones.",
"offset": Vector2(1060, -100),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": "END",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00098, 242.00009),
"speaker": ""
},
&"1_4": {
"dialogue": "Its a table. On it is a note.",
"offset": Vector2(80, 180),
"options": {
0: {
"condition": Array[Dictionary]([]),
"link": &"1_5",
"text": ""
}
},
"size": Vector2(300.00012, 242.00018),
"speaker": ""
},
